# World -1 room 3 (Brush Off), for `NATHAN_MINUS_ONE=3 scripts/record-run --capture`.
# A spike strip too long to jump. Splat on it on purpose; the splat is only paint, so tooting
# off it aims at the spikes under it. Pause mid-toot, pick the one-way platforms: every spike
# in the level is a platform. Walk over.
wait 1.5
tap Enter
wait 1.0
hold Right 0.5
hold Right Space 200ms
wait 1.8
hold Right 0.5
hold Right Space 200ms
wait 0.8
hold Space 140ms
wait 120ms
hold Space 100ms
wait 90ms
tap Esc
wait 1.0
repeat 4
  tap Down
  wait 0.4
end
wait 0.4
tap Enter
wait 1.0
hold Right 2.5
wait 3
